@startuml
skinparam lifelineStrategy solid
autonumber
title Diagrama Cierre 3: POST /api/v1/logistics/closings/warehouse/:transportOrderId (Registro de Cierre Físico de Almacén)

actor "Encargado de Rampa y Chofer" as User
participant "App Web / Móvil" as App
participant "Gateway Controller" as Gateway
participant "Warehouse Closing Service" as Service
participant "Transaction Manager\n(QueryRunner)" as TX
participant "transport_orders DB" as OrdersDB
participant "warehouse_closings DB\n(transport_order_warehouse_closings)" as WhClosingDB
participant "sales_items DB\n(transport_order_sales_items)" as SalesItemsDB
participant "truck_inventories DB" as InvDB
participant "order_histories DB\n(transport_order_histories)" as HistoryDB

User -> App: Revisa conteo físico de retorno en rampa y plasma firmas de chofer y almacenero
App -> Gateway: POST /api/v1/logistics/closings/warehouse/525420010\n(WarehouseClosingPayloadDto)
Gateway -> Service: registerWarehouseClosing(transportOrderId: 525420010, payload, executorId)

Service -> OrdersDB: 1. findOrderById(525420010)
OrdersDB --> Service: order (status: 'IN_DELIVERY' o 'RETURNED_TO_RAMP')

Service -> TX: 2. startTransaction()
activate TX

Service -> WhClosingDB: 3. upsertWarehouseClosing(payloadData)
note right of WhClosingDB
  Registra liquidación física en almacén:
  - total_dispatch_qty, total_invoiced_qty, total_returned_qty
  - total_dispatch_amount, total_invoiced_amount, total_returned_amount
  - driver_signature_svg, warehouse_signature_svg
  - status = 'CLOSED'
end note
WhClosingDB --> Service: savedClosingId

Service -> SalesItemsDB: 4. bulkUpdateSalesItemsReturns(payload.items)
note right of SalesItemsDB
  Actualiza por cada producto:
  - returned_qty = item.returnedQty
  - shortage_qty = item.shortageQty
  - surplus_qty = item.surplusQty
  - status = 'RECONCILED'
end note
SalesItemsDB --> Service: ok

Service -> InvDB: 5. updateTruckInventoriesStatus(525420010, 'UNLOADED_AND_CLOSED')
InvDB --> Service: ok

Service -> OrdersDB: 6. updateOrderStatus(525420010, 'WAREHOUSE_CLOSED')
OrdersDB --> Service: ok

Service -> HistoryDB: 7. insertOrderHistory(525420010, 'WAREHOUSE_CLOSED', 'Cierre físico en almacén completado')
HistoryDB --> Service: ok

Service -> TX: 8. commitTransaction()
deactivate TX

Service --> Gateway: 201 Created (WarehouseClosingResponse)
Gateway --> App: 201 Created JSON { closingId, status: 'CLOSED', transportOrderId: 525420010 }
App --> User: Notificación de éxito y habilitación de liquidación de cobranzas
@enduml
